    "Copy all files from cases/ytmusic_current_playing_timeupdate/testcase/ into perf_testing/hapray/testcases/com.example.myapplication/.",
    "Install each clean signed variant and run the PerfLoad_ytmusic_0010 HapRay testcase for >= 3 rounds.",
